&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Account Director to join our EMEA team and lead integrated marketing campaigns for one of the world&#39;s largest FMCG brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a fast-paced regional role working across multiple markets (from the UK to South Africa and from Norway to the UAE), bringing together Strategy, Creative, Media, Social, Production and local agency teams to deliver outstanding work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role involves managing multiple complex projects simultaneously, partnering closely with clients and internal specialists across the EMEA region, and ensuring campaigns are delivered seamlessly across multiple markets and channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace new ways of working and actively use AI to improve efficiency, simplify processes and deliver smarter solutions for our clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be joining a highly collaborative and supportive team where people trust one another, share ideas openly and work together to solve challenges. We&#39;re looking for someone who enjoys that kind of environment and naturally brings people together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple integrated campaigns across EMEA from briefing through to final delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted day-to-day relationships with clients across different business units, functions and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Strategy and Media teams to develop integrated communications strategies and campaign toolkits that work across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with Creative, Social, Production and local market teams to ensure excellent execution across every touchpoint.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex TV, digital and social production projects, ensuring high-quality execution and efficient delivery across multiple markets, channels and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee campaign timelines, priorities and dependencies across several projects running simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks early, anticipate client needs and proactively solve problems before they escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve ways of working, making collaboration smoother, smarter and more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and lead a team of account managers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualities for Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in complexity: y&lt;/strong&gt;ou&#39;re comfortable juggling five or six projects simultaneously while remaining calm, organised and focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Highly organised:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;you naturally create clarity, structure and momentum, even when working across multiple teams, markets and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brings people together: &lt;/strong&gt;you enjoy working with people from different cultures, disciplines, levels and backgrounds. Whether it&#39;s creatives, strategists, producers, media specialists or clients, you&#39;re able to build trust, align different perspectives and keep everyone moving towards the same goal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solutions-oriented: &lt;/strong&gt;you don&#39;t spend time looking for who&#39;s responsible for a problem. You focus on finding solutions, bringing people together and keeping projects moving forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Takes ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;you anticipate needs, identify potential issues early and proactively drive projects without needing close supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced in complex production: &lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;re comfortable leading large-scale TV, digital and social production projects, coordinating multiple stakeholders and balancing quality, timing and practical delivery considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative: &lt;/strong&gt;you enjoy working in an environment where success is shared, people help one another and great ideas can come from anywhere.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery focused: &lt;/strong&gt;you&#39;re comfortable balancing creative ambition with practical delivery, making smart decisions around production, timelines and available resources while maintaining the highest quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7–10+ years&#39; experience in account management within a creative or integrated agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering integrated campaigns for international or regional brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing large-scale TV, digital and social production projects across multiple markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple client stakeholders across different business functions and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multicultural, international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English (C1 level or above).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with social-first content and integrated campaign production would be highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FMCG experience would be an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be a core contributor to the software systems that keep critical infrastructure, public events, and military operations safe from drone threats. As part of a high-performing engineering team, you will build and evolve the low-level, performance-critical software that sits at the heart of Dedrone&#39;s detection platform. This is a meaningful opportunity to deepen your Rust expertise while driving a strategic modernization effort — working on software that operates at real-world scale with real-world consequences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; This role is based out of our Kassel office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Director RF Engineering&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and maintain high-performance C++ applications within Dedrone&#39;s detection and tracking platform, with a focus on correctness, low latency, and minimal I/O overhead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the incremental migration of existing C++ components to Rust, applying practical Rust development skills in a production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and optimize parallel processing pipelines on Linux systems, ensuring efficient use of multi-core hardware and system resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with teammates in code reviews, architecture discussions, and knowledge sharing — with a shared commitment to clean, maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve performance bottlenecks, memory issues, and concurrency bugs across complex, real-time systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in defining and upholding engineering standards as the team evolves its tooling and language stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional software development experience, with a strong foundation in C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical, hands-on experience developing Rust applications — you have shipped Rust code and understand its ownership and concurrency model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of parallel and concurrent programming patterns and how to apply them safely and efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing and deploying software on Linux systems, including familiarity with system-level APIs and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A methodical approach to performance: you profile before you optimize, and you understand the cost of memory, threads, and I/O&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or a related technical field — or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Studies have shown that women and people of color are less likely to apply to jobs unless they check every box in the job description. If you’re excited about this role and our mission to Protect Life but your experience doesn’t align perfectly with every qualification listed here, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important Notes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above job description is not intended as, nor should it be construed as, exhaustive of all duties, responsibilities, skills, efforts, or working conditions associated with this job. The job description may change or be supplemented at any time in accordance with business needs and conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Some roles may also require legal eligibility to work in a firearms environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We collect personal information from applicants to evaluate candidates for employment. You may request access, deletion, or exercise other CCPA rights at&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- via our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://privacyportal.onetrust.com/webform/0efc1702-9321-4119-bc9d-a06c3a1d3e4e/ca57cc26-a159-4193-9f6e-58ffe3fd2509&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Axon Privacy Web Form&lt;/a&gt;. For more information, please see the Your California Privacy Rights section of our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axon.com/candidateprivacypolicy&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Axon’s mission is to Protect Life and is committed to the well-being and safety of its employees as well as Axon’s impact on the environment. All Axon employees must be aware of and committed to the appropriate environmental, health, and safety regulations, policies, and procedures. Axon employees are empowered to report safety concerns as they arise and activities potentially impacting the environment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer that promotes justice, advances equity, values diversity and fosters inclusion. We’re committed to hiring the best talent — regardless of race, creed, color, ancestry, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship status, marital status, disability, gender identity, genetic information, veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances — and empowering all of our employees so they can do their best work. If you have a disability or special need that requires assistance or accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ---------- &lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;Please note that this email address is for accommodation purposes only. Axon will not respond to inquiries for other purposes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Phishing alert:&amp;nbsp; Axon will never ask you to pay for any part of the hiring process, including training, equipment, or background checks. We do not make job offers via text message, WhatsApp, or instant messaging platforms without a formal interview process.&amp;nbsp; All legitimate job openings are listed on our official careers page at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axon.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.axon.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;If you receive a suspicious offer or outreach from an email address that is not ----- or if you are asked for sensitive personal information (bank details, Social Security Number) prematurely, please ignore the message and report it to &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a backend-leaning Tech Lead to lead a team of 3-4 engineers and own the tech for a part of Superchat’s product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role: You’ll spend roughly half your time designing and building software and the other half enabling your team to perform at its best. Work directly on architecture, development and important projects while creating the clarity, feedback and environment your engineers need to deliver an excellent product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong, current backend engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You bring 3+ years of experience as a Senior or Staff Engineer and remain deeply involved in software development. You are comfortable owning, designing and building crucial parts of production systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experienced with the JVM ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You have substantial experience with Java or another JVM language. Kotlin and AWS experience are a plus, since our backend runs on Kotlin/Quarkus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to lead people.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You may already have worked in a hybrid Tech Lead role, have been an Engineering manager for a short time or be taking your first steps in people leadership after successfully owning projects and architecture. What matters is that you genuiely want to help people grow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong at delivery.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You know how to turn product goals into reality. You are used to work in fast-paced startups and are a driver to increase velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-minded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You care about solving the customers problem. You engage with product decisions, challenge assumptions constructivly and find pragmatic solutions to build things in a lean way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are able to explain complex technical things in details to Engineers and in an understandable way to non-technical stakeholders. You create alignment and motivate people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited about AI-assisted development.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You are already using AI in your development workflow and are eager to explore how it can improve engineering speed, quality and the way teams work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure people manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You no longer want to work directly on software. This role requires meaningful, ongoing involvement in architecture, implementation, code review, and technical problem-solving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hero engineer.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You want to make every important technical decision yourself or become the bottleneck for the team. Your job is to raise the effectiveness of the whole team, not to be the only person who can solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure delivery manager.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You treat engineering as a ticketing operation focused only on timelines and task tracking instead of product quality, technical health, and team growth. We need engineering leaders, not project coordinators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-only operator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You prefer fully remote work and don’t want to actively build relationships and culture in person with the team. We believe strong engineering leadership requires regular in-person collaboration and presence in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spend approximately 50% of your time contributing directly to architecture, development, code reviews, and important technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of 3–4 engineers and take responsibility for its effectiveness, technical quality, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with your Product Manager to understand customer problems, shape solutions, scope projects, and set priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear technical direction while enabling engineers to own decisions and develop their judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular 1:1s, give actionable feedback, and support each engineer’s development and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove blockers, manage dependencies, and help the team identify delivery risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering practices and explore effective uses of AI throughout the software-development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring through technical interviews, structured feedback, and candidate conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director of Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Your manager and partner on people development, calibration, processes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;Engineers in your team; you own their development, performance and growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager:&lt;/strong&gt; PMs own what and why; you own how (delivery) and who (people)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CTO and CPO: &lt;/strong&gt;We are a lean organization with a flat hierarchy. You will regulary disccuss the direction of architecture with the CTO and product with the CPO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission that matters. &lt;/strong&gt;Real impact on small businesses, not abstract metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Funded with conviction. &lt;/strong&gt;$16.5M raised and profitable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern stack. &lt;/strong&gt;Kotlin/Quarkus, AWS, TypeScript/React/Next.js, and LangGraph for AI-powered features&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Squad-based organization. &lt;/strong&gt;Each squad owns its domain end-to-end with real ownership and autonomy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;notion-enable-hover&quot; data-token-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Two clear career tracks&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt; We support both individual contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Management Paths with explicit reversibility between both and Tech Lead being the first level of management that is still quite hands-on&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-led structure. &lt;/strong&gt;PMs report directly to the CPO, keeping product strategy focused, consistent, and clearly prioritized&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid by design. &lt;/strong&gt;Our Berlin office in Prenzlauer Berg is the center of gravity, with two work-from-home days as the standard setup&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct feedback culture. &lt;/strong&gt;Honest, direct, and kind feedback is part of how we work together - in 1:1s, retrospectives, and everyday collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Two clear career tracks. &lt;/strong&gt;We support both Individual Contributor growth (up to Staff level) and Engineering Management paths, with explicit reversibility between both&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club/John Reed membership or a public transport/Dance subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual personal development budget of €500 for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that enables fast professional and personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s important to us to create an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together - whether that’s through HYROX training, golfing, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or whatever kind of community you’d like to help build here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re looking for people with passion, grit, and integrity. You&#39;re encouraged to apply even if your experience doesn&#39;t precisely match the description. At Superchat, we welcome diverse perspectives and people who think rigorously.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocating to Berlin? We support you with practical relocation help. You&#39;ll feel home in no time.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With your application you agree to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.notion.so/f601741cb4f24d418411aa0ff86c3787?pvs=21&quot;&gt;privacy policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with various design options, industrial offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company manufactures aspirational, sustainable, and affordable homes using timber construction methods. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, boost Europe&#39;s strength in innovation, while also playing a substantial role in improving sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Architekt:in mit Schwerpunkt in den Leistungsphasen 2–4 bist du Teil unseres interdisziplinären Planungsteams bei GROPYUS und arbeitest aktiv an der Entwicklung und Umsetzung innovativer Wohngebäude mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du begleitest unsere Projekte von der Entwurfsplanung bis zur Genehmigungsplanung und arbeitest dabei eng mit internen Fachplaner:innen, Projektleitungen sowie unserem Building System Team zusammen. Durch deine strukturierte und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise trägst du dazu bei, hochwertige, effiziente und nachhaltige Wohngebäude zu realisieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deiner Rolle übernimmst du Verantwortung für die planerische Ausarbeitung von Projekten, koordinierst Schnittstellen innerhalb des Planungsteams und bringst deine Erfahrung im Wohnungsbau sicher in die Projektarbeit ein. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf einer qualitativ hochwertigen Planung, einer engen interdisziplinären Zusammenarbeit sowie der digitalen Planung in Revit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aufgaben und Verantwortlichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Entwurfs-, Genehmigungs- und Ausführungsgrundlagen in Revit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung architektonischer Lösungen unter Berücksichtigung technischer, funktionaler und wirtschaftlicher Anforderungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abstimmung und Koordination mit internen Fachplaner:innen sowie externen Projektbeteiligten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der Erstellung von Präsentationen, Planungskonzepten und Genehmigungsunterlagen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung der Planungsqualität sowie Einhaltung projektbezogener Standards und Prozesse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitwirkung an der kontinuierlichen Weiterentwicklung unseres digitalen und seriellen Planungssystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung der Projekt- und Planungsleitung bei organisatorischen und planerischen Aufgaben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Studium der Architektur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindestens 5 Jahre Berufserfahrung in der Planung von Wohnungsbauprojekten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse in den Leistungsphasen LP2–LP4 nach HOAI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse in Revit und eine hohe Affinität zu digitaler Planung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im mehrgeschossigen Wohnungsbau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im Holzbau ist ein Plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte, sorgfältige und eigenverantwortliche Arbeitsweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude an der Zusammenarbeit in interdisziplinären Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Einen befristeten Vertrag (bis Juli 2027) mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;POSITION OVERVIEW&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product marketing at Mews is at a turning point. The function has been effective at launching products; what it has not yet built is the strategic layer that comes after launch – the continuous positioning, adoption strategy, and market intelligence that makes each product more valuable over time. This role owns that shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director of Product Marketing and Market Research is a combined senior leadership role responsible for two things that should never have been separated: how Mews brings products to market, and how Mews understands the market it operates in. You will lead the product marketing team, own the research and customer insights function, and serve as the go-to authority on both disciplines for senior leadership across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mews operates across property management, fintech and payments, guest experience, and marketplace. The right person for this role knows how to build a coherent positioning story across a complex multi-product portfolio – and how to ground that story in real market intelligence, customer insight, and competitive understanding rather than assumption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Product marketing strategy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and own product marketing strategy across the Mews portfolio – covering positioning, messaging, and go-to-market execution from launch through adoption and ongoing engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and govern the global product launch framework so that launches are scalable and repeatable, with clear handoffs between strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own product adoption and post-launch engagement strategy – moving the function beyond launch execution to continuous market thinking that drives usage, retention, and revenue contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Product, Sales, RevOps, and Customer Success to ensure product marketing strategy connects to commercial outcomes and is reflected in how the business goes to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own NPS tracking programs and design the measurement framework for product marketing impact, including product attach rates, adoption metrics, and pipeline contribution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Market research and customer insights&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the end-to-end market research function: identifying research opportunities, designing methodology, running studies, synthesising findings, and activating insights across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead primary and secondary research initiatives that inform strategic, commercial, and product decisions – including competitive analysis, customer behaviour, market sizing, and buyer intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build competitive intelligence as a structured, ongoing discipline – not a one-off project. Translate competitive signals into positioning decisions, sales enablement, and product roadmap input.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the functional authority on what the market is telling Mews, and translate that into insight narratives that influence senior leadership decisions and business strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with Strategy, Product, RevOps, and Marketing to ensure insights land where decisions get made, not just where they get read.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Team and function leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and develop a team of product marketers, setting clear expectations, building capability, and creating a culture of commercial accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set the operating model for how the team works with AI – determining where AI handles execution tasks and where human judgment is irreplaceable, and building team-level standards accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the senior leadership go-to on product marketing and market intelligence – the person any executive can trust for a well-grounded, commercially-connected answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Represent product marketing and research in executive forums, contributing to annual planning and portfolio prioritisation decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;REQUIREMENTS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Professional knowledge and experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;10+ years in B2B SaaS marketing, with the majority of that time in product marketing – not demand generation, not agency, not brand-only roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Has held a Director, Senior Director, or Head of Product Marketing title, or a broader marketing leadership title that included ownership of the product marketing function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven track record managing and developing a multi-person product marketing team, including hiring, coaching, and performance management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience owning or significantly contributing to a market research or customer insights function – primary research methodology, competitive intelligence programs, or voice-of-customer work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep understanding of B2B SaaS go-to-market strategy: positioning, messaging architecture, pricing and packaging alignment, sales enablement, and lifecycle marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building or significantly reshaping a product marketing function – not just managing an inherited one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Has operated in a lean, fast-moving environment such as a scale-up, growth-stage, or pre-IPO company. Experience only in large enterprise environments with unlimited resources is unlikely to be a strong fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Skills and capabilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Owns GTM strategy end-to-end – from initial positioning through post-launch adoption and continuous market engagement. Experience limited to launch execution is not sufficient.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Connects product marketing directly to revenue outcomes. Can articulate how their work has influenced pipeline, product attach rates, adoption, or retention – not just campaign outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Translates research into business decisions – not just insight reports. Has a track record of research that changed a strategic or commercial direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multi-functional marketing experience beyond product marketing, for example content, SEO, digital, demand generation, or go-to-market strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrics-driven. Comfortable defining and owning the measurement framework for both product marketing impact and research quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong senior stakeholder communication. Able to influence executive decisions, present with authority, and earn trust through substance rather than seniority alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Publicly visible in the product marketing or insights community – speaker, writer, or recognised contributor to the discipline. Not a requirement, but a meaningful differentiator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI fluency&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing the product marketing function in a way that is more structural than any other recent technology shift. A significant part of this role is deciding what that means for the team at Mews – what AI handles, what stays human, and how to build a team that operates at a higher strategic level as execution work is automated.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect this person to: use AI tools deliberately and with criteria; describe specific examples of AI changing how they or their team works strategically; have a point of view on where the product marketing function is heading as AI matures; and build team-level standards for AI use, including how to review and quality-control AI-assisted outputs before they reach senior stakeholders or customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fintech, payments, or financial services product marketing experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hospitality, travel tech, or hotel SaaS background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Both fintech and hospitality in one profile is the strongest possible combination for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;DACH region or Germany market experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in a company that has undergone a go-to-market transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s Hardware Development team builds the physical products millions of small businesses rely on every day, and this role sits right at the start of a new chapter: moving our in-house hardware onto the Android platform for the first time. This isn&#39;t a typical Android device, it&#39;s a highly customised, security-first product built from scratch, which means the person joining will help define how the operating system, drivers, and secure processor come together rather than inheriting someone else&#39;s setup. The team works closely with hardware, software, and QA engineers across the bring-up process, so this role offers a rare chance to shape a product&#39;s foundations while working alongside experienced embedded and secure processor leads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support system bring-up for the new Android embedded platform, from bootloader through to kernel and framework&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate and maintain kernel modules and drivers, including power management and connectivity components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to build system integration across the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug hardware and software issues at the protocol level and help resolve critical issues found during testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out testing and validation to confirm the platform is stable and secure before release&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing embedded systems with a strong focus on Android OS, gained over several years in a professional setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the Android OS architecture, from bootloader (U-Boot, Little Kernel) and kernel through to framework and services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience debugging hardware interfaces at protocol level, including I2C, SPI, UART, and SDIO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of embedded security concepts such as Secure Boot, TrustZone (TEE), dm-verity, encryption, and hardware-backed key storage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with Qualcomm Snapdragon or MediaTek platforms, and expert-level C programming for embedded Linux environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At JetBrains, code is our passion. Ever since we started back in 2000, we have strived to create the strongest and most effective developer tools in the world. Today, we are evolving beyond standalone tools toward a unified, AI-native platform for software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is no longer just an assistant inside the editor – it is becoming an active participant in how software is planned, built, reviewed, and operated across teams and organizations. This shift brings challenges that cannot be solved at the level of individual tools alone, challenges that involve governance, security, cost control, observability, and coordination between humans and autonomous agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;JetBrains Platform team (JCP)&lt;/strong&gt; is building the foundation that connects developer workflows, team-level collaboration, and organizational control into a single coherent system. The platform is both deeply integrated with JetBrains products and designed to work across teams, products, and environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re now looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join an identity management and access team in JCP. The team owns several services responsible for authentication and authorization, as well as for managing organizations, user memberships, groups, and workspaces. All these form a foundational dependency for the rest of the platform. We also supply and support robust authentication components used by YouTrack, IDE Services, License Vault, Qodana, and other JetBrains products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the entire SDLC: codebase, architecture, and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and evolve the services in Kotlin and a little bit of Go, ensuring reliability and performance as the platform grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement new features across the identity, organization, membership, group, and workspace domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and integrate PRs from other platform teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage integrations with other JCP platform components and connected applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We will be happy to have you on our team if you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have 7+ years of JVM development experience, preferably with Kotlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know how to approach performance problems on JVM and Postgres&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are experienced in building and operating SaaS production services in a distributed, multi-tenant environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can fluently navigate a modern devops stack: K8S, OpenTelemetry, Grafana&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of taking over and improving existing production services&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with identity management protocols, such as OAuth 2.0, OIDC, SAML 2.0, or SCIM 2.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If you have designed and evolved domain models for organizational or identity systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cybersecurity experience: estimating risks, recognizing common vulnerability antipatterns, and promoting best SSDLC practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
